  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nRarely does an opportunity of this calibre present itself on Paritai Drive. Elevated on an impressive 902m² site, 135 Paritai Drive offers an exceptional opportunity to unlock the full potential of one of Auckland’s most tightly held and prestigious waterfront-facing addresses.\r\n\r\nOriginally built in the early 1960s, the existing two-storey residence remains largely in its original form, providing a unique starting point for those with vision. Whether the ambition is to redevelop, renovate, replace or create a landmark new residence, the combination of land, elevation, outlook and position creates an extraordinary platform for transformation.\r\n\r\nThe elevated site commands panoramic views across Hobson Bay and Auckland’s iconic harbour, providing the essential ingredients for an outstanding architectural statement. The generous landholding, private swimming pool, established gardens and existing residence provide scope to explore a range of future possibilities, subject of course to the necessary planning and council approvals.\r\n\r\nThe current home comprises a self-contained ground-floor granny flat, with the upper level opening to expansive harbour views through large picture windows and flowing outdoors to the balcony, pool and landscaped grounds.\r\n\r\nAfter more than 50 years under the same ownership, the vendor has decided it is time for a new chapter.\r\n\r\nFor those looking beyond what currently stands, this is fundamentally an opportunity to secure an exceptional piece of land in an exceptional position — and create something truly remarkable.\r\n\r\n135 Paritai Drive is seriously for sale.",
